      "description": "Item da lista 'Kits para presentear': miniatura, nome em serifa, descrição curta, preço e seta.",
      "html": "<a class=\"ds-kitl\" href=\"#\"><span class=\"ds-kitl-i\"></span><span class=\"ds-kitl-b\"><span class=\"ds-kitl-n\">Conjunto Aurora</span><span class=\"ds-kitl-s\">Brinco Gota Aurora + Colar Ponto de Luz.</span><span class=\"ds-kitl-p\">R$ 199,90</span></span><svg class=\"ds-kitl-seta\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6\"/></svg></a>",
      "css": ".ds-kitl{display:grid;grid-template-columns:96px minmax(0,1fr) 20px;gap:20px;align-items:center;width:440px;padding:18px 4px;border-block:1px solid #E8DAD0;color:#38291F;text-decoration:none;font-family:Jost,system-ui,sans-serif}.ds-kitl-i{display:block;aspect-ratio:1;border-radius:16px;background:#EAD9C6;transition:transform .5s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1)}.ds-kitl-b{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:3px}.ds-kitl-n{font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',Georgia,serif;font-size:26px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.1}.ds-kitl-s{color:#6B4E3D;font-size:14px}.ds-kitl-p{font-size:15px;font-weight:500}.ds-kitl-seta{color:#6B4E3D;transition:transform .3s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1)}.ds-kitl:hover .ds-kitl-seta{transform:translateX(4px);color:#38291F}.ds-kitl:hover .ds-kitl-i{transform:scale(1.04)}.ds-kitl:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #38291F;outline-offset:2px;border-radius:14px}"
